{"words": [{"text": "وَبَشِّرِ", "translation": "And give good news"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "(to) those who"}, {"text": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "translation": "believe"}, {"text": "وَعَمِلُوا۟", "translation": "and do"}, {"text": "ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ", "translation": "[the] righteous deeds"}, {"text": "أَنَّ", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "لَهُمْ", "translation": "for them"}, {"text": "جَنَّـٰتٍۢ", "translation": "(will be) Gardens"}, {"text": "تَجْرِى", "translation": "flow"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "[from]"}, {"text": "تَحْتِهَا", "translation": "under them"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ ۖ", "translation": "the rivers"}, {"text": "كُلَّمَا", "translation": "Every time"}, {"text": "رُزِقُوا۟", "translation": "they are provided"}, {"text": "مِنْهَا", "translation": "therefrom"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "ثَمَرَةٍۢ", "translation": "fruit"}, {"text": "رِّزْقًۭا ۙ", "translation": "(as) provision"}, {"text": "قَالُوا۟", "translation": "they (will) say"}, {"text": "هَـٰذَا", "translation": "This (is)"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِى", "translation": "the one which"}, {"text": "رُزِقْنَا", "translation": "we were provided"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "قَبْلُ ۖ", "translation": "before"}, {"text": "وَأُتُوا۟", "translation": "And they will be given"}, {"text": "بِهِۦ", "translation": "therefrom"}, {"text": "مُتَشَـٰبِهًۭا ۖ", "translation": "(things) in resemblance"}, {"text": "وَلَهُمْ", "translation": "And for them"}, {"text": "فِيهَآ", "translation": "therein"}, {"text": "أَزْوَٰجٌۭ", "translation": "spouses"}, {"text": "مُّطَهَّرَةٌۭ ۖ", "translation": "purified"}, {"text": "وَهُمْ", "translation": "and they"}, {"text": "فِيهَا", "translation": "therein"}, {"text": "خَـٰلِدُونَ", "translation": "(will) abide forever"}], "sahih": "And give good tidings to those who believe and do righteous deeds that they will have gardens [in Paradise] beneath which rivers flow. Whenever they are provided with a provision of fruit therefrom, they will say, \"This is what we were provided with before.\" And it is given to them in likeness. And they will have therein purified spouses, and they will abide therein eternally."}